# RAW DATA LIVES OUTSIDE THIS REPOSITORY, in ../data/ -- one directory per
# source, each with a SOURCE.md. It used to sit under verification/ and be
# excluded here: 2.3 GB of it, inside a git working tree, held back by two
# lines of .gitignore. That is a trap rather than a rule (one `git add -A`,
# one `git clean -xfd`, one fresh clone), and a 2.6 GB repository cannot be
# backed up or cloned like a repository.
#
# What the contracts read is the EXTRACT -- verification/*.txt, two columns
# of numbers with the source in the file header -- so this repository is
# self-contained without the raw data. See verification/README.md.

# scratch cases for pictures and probes; no contracts, not scanned by tests
cases/scratch/

# sync tarballs from the cloud session
_stage*.tgz
